# Caddy config for Textile Shop Manager — gives you free, automatic HTTPS
# with a real certificate, no manual certbot/nginx setup needed.
#
# SETUP:
#   1. Replace "yourshop.com" below with your actual domain (must already
#      point to this server's IP address — see ../README.md).
#   2. Install Caddy: https://caddyserver.com/docs/install
#   3. Copy this file to /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
#   4. sudo systemctl reload caddy
#
# That's it — Caddy automatically requests and renews an HTTPS certificate
# from Let's Encrypt, and forwards all traffic to the app running on
# port 4000 (started separately via the systemd service).

yourshop.com {
	reverse_proxy localhost:4000
}
